  "description": "Compendium adapter for Supabase Storage (cloud and self-hosted). Implements the IObjectStore port over the native Supabase Storage REST API with tenant-scoped keys, streaming uploads, presigned download URLs, signed upload URLs, public URLs, and image transforms. Ships a per-connection storage factory and a redacting credential model for multi-project platforms.",
